# Goldens are compared byte-for-byte and regenerated in place. Python's
# text-mode round trip is separator-tolerant (universal newlines on read),
# but a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=false would see every golden as
# fully modified after a regen writes CRLF. Pin LF on both checkout and
# checkin so the tree stays byte-identical on every OS and git config.
test/data/golden/** text eol=lf
